        # ── Mode D: CUT ───────────────────────────────────────────────
        # A long delivery -- a whole reel as one movie, or one EXR
        # sequence of several shots -- split at its cuts. ffmpeg scores
        # every frame change once (the scene score, 0..1); the slider
